# A shell's faces changed on its screen (ROADMAP F7): the extrusion of
# path_extrude hollowed open at its top, as in ext_shell; [change] with
# nothing selected activates the extrusion, whose faces the shell takes
# away, and says what to select; with the top and, in the isometric
# view, a side picked, [take the selection] opens both; [remove] on the
# top's row leaves the side open alone. Check Solid finds it sound.
key r
move 200 200
down L 200 200
up L 200 200
move 380 330
down L 380 330
up L 380 330
key esc
key x shift
# Its depth held and typed as 80 on its screen: the model was drawn
# for a deep part, deeper than a new extrusion of this sketch starts.
twmove 501 125
twdown L 501 125
twup L 501 125
twmove 501 125
twdown L 501 125
twup L 501 125
edit 80
click-face top face of g003-extrude
menu Features|Shell Solid
tw
answer ok
twmove 195 145
twdown L 195 145
twup L 195 145
click-face top face of g003-extrude
view iso
click-face side face of g003-extrude from r006-line-segment
twmove 195 145
twdown L 195 145
twup L 195 145
tw
twmove 303 165
twdown L 303 165
twup L 303 165
tw
twmove 312 75
twdown L 312 75
twup L 312 75
answer ok
menu Analyze|Check Solid
dump
